<pre class="terminal">
  GET /merchants/ecommerce/returns/DEMO-RETURN-INSPECTION
  POST /merchants/ecommerce/returns/DEMO-RETURN-INSPECTION/submit_inspection
</pre>

Submitting any of its item's `inspection.options` answers with the same return, unchanged. The
files are not stored.

